I like it because
 * it coins meaningful words (you know by the rafsi what it is)
 * it coins words rather uniformly, about as 'neutral' as you can get
 * it defers difficult distractions, like international standards, to
a larger, more accountable and qualified decision-making body

and also
 * it's automated
 * the script is 1KB

